    "title": "Top 10 Men's Shows of the Fall 2026 Season - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Abbie Soule ,\n10 days ago The Fall 2026 menswear season found itself retreating into the safe space of conservative-leaning traditional tailoring and the tried-and-tested casual cool of collegiate cos-play, yet, across Milan and Paris there were small acts of defiance that leaned into the beginnings of a return to something more maximalist while simultaneously rejecting the idea of perfection in a challenge to uneasy times. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
